OL,3,AEurope plans to catch the next computer
OL,4,Achip wave                              
OL,6,F"Photonic chips are on the verge of a  
OL,7,Fbreakthrough," says Ton van Mol of the 
OL,8,FDutch research institute TNO.          
OL,10,FIf van Mol is right ` and TNO, the     
OL,11,FEuropean Union and the Dutch government
OL,12,Fare backing the idea with millions of  
OL,13,Feuros - then the technology could be a 
OL,14,Fgamechanger.                           
OL,16,FThe chips which run today's society,   
OL,17,Ffrom your phone and TV, to the vast    
OL,18,Fdata centres meeting our insatiable    
OL,19,Fdesire for AI, are mostly electrical.  
